--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiMakesSomeDripDecisions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307007
    - rid: 7856103004196307008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah jeez... it's already evening?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307009
    - rid: 7856103004196307010
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (That rain took way too long to go away...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, apprentice-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307012
    - rid: 7856103004196307013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Or, should I say Harbinger-to-Be?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I take it you received my message?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure did- a shame the rain kept us for so long.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed, while part of me was eager to advise you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Another part was fine letting my old bones rest to the sounds of the
      rain falling on my roof.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Those bones <i>are</i> looking pretty old...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Ahem</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307022
    - rid: 7856103004196307031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I've noticed that you've been wearing that leather armor since you've
      arrived in Jorrvaskr-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307023
    - rid: 7856103004196307032
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Would it be safe to say that you prefer light armor over heavy armor?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... I guess so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. That does make things a bit trickier for us-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: If you preferred heavy armor it'd be a simple endeavor; we'd just make
      you some wolf armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... wolf armor?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307027
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: The kind that Vilkas wears.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ooh... gotcha.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: But, since you prefer light armor, we'll have to get... creative.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307029
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Truth be told, all the preserved traditions for a Harbinger's armor are
      all heavy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to say there weren't ever Harbingers that preferred light armor,
      like yourself-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: But that their legacy has been lost to time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, the choice of material is critical, and a bit of a challenge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307030
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: On the lower-end of the spectrum are furs and leathers-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, while easy to find and cheap to purchase, wouldn't do you much
      better than what you have.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: You could have an elven armor made of moonstone-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: But we'd have to make a completely original design to avoid any unnecessary
      Altmeri influence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: (Especially now...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: The strongest set of armor would be made out of Malachite Glass-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Which while regal and somewhat divorced from elven influence, is expensive.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Are those really my only options?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: If you want your armor to be done some time this year? Yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Tell me more about the-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You could try dragon scale.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?!?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307038
    - rid: 7856103004196307039
    - rid: 7856103004196307040
    - rid: 7856103004196307041
    - rid: 7856103004196307044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And I'm here too!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307042
    - rid: 7856103004196307043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Dang, the both of you are still in one piece!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307045
    - rid: 7856103004196307046
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Real talk though, {mc} are you alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307047
    - rid: 7856103004196307051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We are going to talk about that <i>later</i>. Okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307049
    - rid: 7856103004196307059
    - rid: 7856103004196307081
    - rid: 7856103004196307082
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah, okay...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Goodie~!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307053
    - rid: 7856103004196307054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307060
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: This is quite the reunion, how's that Dwarven sword treating you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? This thing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307056
    - rid: 7856103004196307057
    - rid: 7856103004196307058
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It helped me take down Alduin, so I guess it's been pretty good so far.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307062
    - rid: 7856103004196307063
    - rid: 7856103004196307064
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Shor's blood, I never thought I'd see the day where a weapon I forged
      would slay Alduin...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307065
    - rid: 7856103004196307066
    - rid: 7856103004196307067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Good for you, Eorlund.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307083
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, what'd you say about dragon scales?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307068
    - rid: 7856103004196307069
    - rid: 7856103004196307070
    - rid: 7856103004196307074
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, Natsuki seemed to want other options for her armor-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307072
    - rid: 7856103004196307073
    - rid: 7856103004196307075
    - rid: 7856103004196307084
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And dragon scale is the only one you didn't mention.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307076
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I might've mentioned it if collecting dragon scales were within the realm
      of possiblity-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307077
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Though, if even Alduin can be slain...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I <i>should</i> be looking into how they are tempered into being
      usable as armor...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You should be able to get some from the remains of the dragon that attacked
      the Western Watchtower-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307078
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Assuming no one started scavenging it already.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103004196307079
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm, in that case...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: If you're interested in bearing dragon scale, apprentice, then go get
      some and come back tomorrow.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Dragon scale's tough, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738882
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's as tough as light armor gets, yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738883
    - rid: 7856103025775738884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, let's go see if the dragon at the Western Watchtower's still
      got its scales-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738885
    - rid: 7856103025775738886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, where'd Sayori go?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738887
    - rid: 7856103025775738888
    - rid: 7856103025775738891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, now noticing that Sayori isn''t where she was just a minute ago,
      turns around to look for her...'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738889
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: He doesn't have to look far, though, Sayori's just down by the Gildergreen
      tree, walking Meeko back up to the Skyforge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738890
    - rid: 7856103025775738892
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: She's coming back up here, let's meet her halfway and head out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '''ight.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738894
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738895
    - rid: 7856103025775738897
    - rid: 7856103025775738898
    - rid: 7856103025775738960
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! Hey, {mc}, Natsuki-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738899
    - rid: 7856103025775738900
    - rid: 7856103025775738907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Were you two looking for me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738901
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, I spotted you from back up at the forge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738902
    - rid: 7856103025775738903
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What's up with the dog?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738904
    - rid: 7856103025775738905
    - rid: 7856103025775738906
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Let me introduce you! His name is Meeko, and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738961
    - rid: 7856103025775738962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 491799c9d5b8c2649bb20546f506fa86, type: 2}
    dialog: Bork! Bork!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738963
    - rid: 7856103025775738965
    - rid: 7856103025775738966
    - rid: 7856103025775738968
    - rid: 7856103025775738967
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The heck did I do?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738969
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Down boy, bad! Natsuki is a friend, too!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738970
    - rid: 7856103025775738971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess he doesn't like werewolves-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738972
    - rid: 7856103025775738973
    - rid: 7856103025775738974
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Former! I got my lycanthropy cured!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738975
    - rid: 7856103025775738976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. My bad.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738977
    - rid: 7856103045627904131
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever, let's just go get those scales...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738979
    - rid: 7856103025775738980
    - rid: 7856103025775738981
    - rid: 7856103025775738982
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And, before I forget-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738983
    - rid: 7856103025775738984
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Get a handle on your pet, Sayori!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738985
    - rid: 7856103025775738986
    - rid: 7856103045627904130
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738988
    - rid: 7856103025775738989
    - rid: 7856103025775738990
    - rid: 7856103025775738991
    - rid: 7856103025775738992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, this thing''s just a pile of bones. Where''s the scales?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738993
    - rid: 7856103025775738994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Dunno, in the game you can kinda just "search" the skeleton and somehow
      find scales.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738995
    - rid: 7856103025775738996
    - rid: 7856103025775738997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's see if there aren't any lying around underneath the skeleton or
      nearby...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} and Natsuki begin snooping around for scales, while Sayori stands
      off to the side with Meeko.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775738999
    - rid: 7856103025775739000
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739001
    - rid: 7856103025775739002
    - rid: 7856103025775739003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: About an hour of searching later, the sun has begun to set...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, Natsuki, let's get all the scales we found in one big pile.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739004
    - rid: 7856103025775739005
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Jeez, do I really gotta lug these heavy things around some more?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739006
    - rid: 7856103025775739009
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're going to be taking them back to Whiterun, aren't we?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739010
    - rid: 7856103025775739011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Might as well get a head count for Eorlund so he knows how much he's
      working with.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh... Fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739013
    - rid: 7856103025775739014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki and {mc} go around to the disparate smaller piles of scales they
      found and put them all together.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739015
    - rid: 7856103025775739016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In total, they've collected a pile of scales that weighs about a hundred
      pounds.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739027
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh... there should <i>probably</i> be enough here for your new armor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739017
    - rid: 7856103025775739018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably?!? After all this time, there had better be enough...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739019
    - rid: 7856103025775739020
    - rid: 7856103025775739025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Less complaining, more lugging-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739021
    - rid: 7856103025775739022
    - rid: 7856103025775739026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got drinks and a warm bed waiting for you back at Jorrvaskr, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739023
    - rid: 7856103025775739024
    - rid: 7856103025775739028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739029
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The scales are divvied between Sayori, {mc}, and Natsuki- with {mc} taking
      the largest share.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739030
    - rid: 7856103025775739031
    - rid: 7856103025775739032
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: On the way back to Whiterun, {mc} starts walking ahead of the other two,
      with Meeko following him closely-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739035
    - rid: 7856103025775739036
    - rid: 7856103025775739037
    - rid: 7856103025775739038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which Sayori takes as an opportunity to have the conversation that she
      promised with Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739039
    - rid: 7856103025775739040
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739041
    - rid: 7856103025775739042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Haahh... haaahh... <NoiseText=3,1>What</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739043
    - rid: 7856103025775739044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739045
    - rid: 7856103025775739046
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry. What do you want?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739047
    - rid: 7856103025775739048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, he, uh-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: When he left yesterday, he was trying to kill himself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739051
    - rid: 7856103025775739052
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki almost drops the scales she was carrying, but quickly re-tightens
      her grip on them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah... <NoiseText=1,1>shit</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Does anyone else know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I told Monika- I don't think Yuri knows.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739055
    - rid: 7856103025775739056
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... tsk.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739057
    - rid: 7856103025775739058
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What're we supposed to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know. Monika doesn't know, either.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739060
    - rid: 7856103025775739061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739062
    - rid: 7856103025775739088
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've got an idea.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739064
    - rid: 7856103025775739065
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What? What is it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739066
    - rid: 7856103025775739067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of you are joining the Companions.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739068
    - rid: 7856103025775739069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How's <i>that</i> supposed to help?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Simple: he''s going to be too busy being needed to kill himself.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739072
    - rid: 7856103025775739073
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But that's not helping! Being forced to do things might make his condition
      worse!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739074
    - rid: 7856103025775739075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, Monika said that we shouldn't be doing anything interesting with
      {mc}-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: To keep <b>the player</b> away...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739076
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{Player}, you here?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739077
    - rid: 7856103025775739078
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739079
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, <i>that's</i> <b>your</b> name...?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: A lot of good your "do nothing interesting" plan did, huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739080
    - rid: 7856103025775739081
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, I'm not just trying to keep his hands busy-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739082
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm trying to put some purpose into his life.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, if I'm not mistaken-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739083
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Is part of the reason that being a fake person is so horrible: the lack
      of a real purpose.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739084
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739085
    - rid: 7856103025775739086
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But this is all just some game, especially to him!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103025775739087
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How is making him "play" the game gonna give him purpose?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904000
    - rid: 7856103045627904001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Crap... uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904002
    - rid: 7856103045627904003
    - rid: 7856103045627904020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah! I got it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904004
    - rid: 7856103045627904005
    - rid: 7856103045627904021
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You know how Monika said we might have a way out?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904007
    - rid: 7856103045627904008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Alright, get this:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904009
    - rid: 7856103045627904010
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Dudes like being the bread winners for their families, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Isn't that a stereotype born from centuries of patriarchical society
      that-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904011
    - rid: 7856103045627904012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Doesn't accurately reflect the true desires of those affected, both men
      and women?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I just thought he might like making sure we're fed and stuff...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Even though <i>I'm</i> technically in charge... heh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: From my experience, I've seen him act more like a stay-at-home husband
      than a breadwinner.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Pfft-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904018
    - rid: 7856103045627904019
    - rid: 7856103045627904025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course <i>you'd</i> know what kind of husband he'd be.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904022
    - rid: 7856103045627904023
    - rid: 7856103045627904026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Shut up!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, while we worry about how to get out of here-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904079
    - rid: 7856103045627904080
    - rid: 7856103045627904081
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He can just worry about making sure we're okay.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Even before all of this, that was kind of his whole deal, no?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904082
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm... when you put it like that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904083
    - rid: 7856103045627904084
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904085
    - rid: 7856103045627904086
    - rid: 7856103045627904098
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: All the dragon scales have successfully been delivered to Natsuki's room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904087
    - rid: 7856103045627904088
    - rid: 7856103045627904089
    - rid: 7856103045627904090
    - rid: 7856103045627904091
    - rid: 7856103045627904092
    - rid: 7856103045627904132
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Took you two long enough.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904093
    - rid: 7856103045627904094
    - rid: 7856103045627904095
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you needed help, you could've just asked.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904096
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, whatever. Thanks for the help, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904097
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, Miss Not-suki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904100
    - rid: 7856103045627904101
    - rid: 7856103045627904102
    - rid: 7856103045627904103
    - rid: 7856103045627904104
    - rid: 7856103045627904105
    - rid: 7856103045627904106
    - rid: 7856103045627904107
    - rid: 7856103045627904108
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, what is it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904109
    - rid: 7856103045627904110
    - rid: 7856103045627904111
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Um- Thanks again for giving me a place to stay...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904112
    - rid: 7856103045627904113
    - rid: 7856103045627904134
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. You're welcome.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904114
    - rid: 7856103045627904117
    - rid: 7856103045627904123
    - rid: 7856103045627904135
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that... Lucia?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904118
    - rid: 7856103045627904133
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know me, mister?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904119
    - rid: 7856103045627904120
    - rid: 7856103045627904136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah... You took her in, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904121
    - rid: 7856103045627904122
    - rid: 7856103045627904124
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What? You wouldn't?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904125
    - rid: 7856103045627904126
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, I have before, but that's not the point-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904127
    - rid: 7856103045627904128
    - rid: 7856103045627904129
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: H-huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904143
    - rid: 7856103045627904145
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: She looks... different from what I remember.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904140
    - rid: 7856103045627904141
    - rid: 7856103045627904142
    - rid: 7856103045627904144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Really? Does that matter?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904146
    - rid: 7856103045627904147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904148
    - rid: 7856103045627904149
    - rid: 7856103045627904150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori... do her eyes look familiar to you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904151
    - rid: 7856103045627904152
    - rid: 7856103045627904153
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah... they do...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But I don't remember where I've seen them before, sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904155
    - rid: 7856103045627904156
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904157
    - rid: 7856103045627904158
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, can I go to bed now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904159
    - rid: 7856103045627904160
    - rid: 7856103045627904161
    - rid: 7856103045627904163
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course. Get a good night's rest, Lucia.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904162
    - rid: 7856103045627904164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you, Miss Not-suki!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904165
    - rid: 7856103045627904166
    - rid: 7856103045627904167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You not gonna correct her about how to say your name?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904168
    - rid: 7856103045627904169
    - rid: 7856103045627904170
    - rid: 7856103045627904171
    - rid: 7856103045627904172
    - rid: 7856103045627904173
    - rid: 7856103045627904174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, she's just a kid-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904175
    - rid: 7856103045627904176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, I think it's cute.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904177
    - rid: 7856103045627904178
    - rid: 7856103045627904179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You two know where you're spending the night?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904180
    - rid: 7856103045627904181
    - rid: 7856103045627904182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I figured we'd just hit up the Bannered Mare.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904183
    - rid: 7856103045627904184
    - rid: 7856103045627904185
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904186
    - rid: 7856103045627904187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Make sure you don't knock her up, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904188
    - rid: 7856103045627904189
    - rid: 7856103045627904190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I wasn't planning on it...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904191
    - rid: 7856103045627904192
    - rid: 7856103045627904193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, and when you get up tomorrow, could you get over here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904194
    - rid: 7856103045627904195
    - rid: 7856103045627904196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've got more stuff that I need help with.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, sure, I don't see why not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904197
    - rid: 7856103045627904198
    - rid: 7856103045627904199
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Good. See you two tomorrow.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904200
    - rid: 7856103045627904201
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, {mc}, and their dog start heading toward the Bannered Mare for
      the night.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904202
    - rid: 7856103045627904203
    - rid: 7856103045627904204
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Haaahh... It's been a long day.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103045627904205
    - rid: 7856103045627904206
